From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uiautomationcore: client pattern objects, typed properties, text, events

uiautomationcore: client pattern objects, typed properties, text, events

UI Automation client and provider side, the documented surface that was stubbed:

- every pattern has its client COM object (IUIAutomation*Pattern, current and
  cached members, Text/Text2/TextEdit/TextChild with text ranges) and the
  provider forwards behind it;
- all property ids are typed, element and element-array properties cross
  threads, GetCurrent/CachedPropertyValueEx return the documented default
  unless ignoreDefaultValue is set, property conditions honour
  MatchSubstring;
- IUIAutomation6 proxy factory entries and mapping, programmatic names,
  PollForPotentialSupported*, ShowContextMenu, GetCurrentMetadataValue,
  UiaLookupId for text attribute, annotation, style and changes GUIDs;
- UiaRaiseActiveTextPositionChangedEvent and the COM handler, per-window
  UiaEventRemoveWindow, nested node cloning and win-event answer, node
  stand-in SetFocus/BoundingRectangle, UiaGetUpdatedCache scope validation;
- the IAccessible bridge answers IDispatch from the oleacc type library and
  its enumerator clones;
- the class factory no longer keeps a pointer to the caller's CLSID.
---
